4 PET containers, same design, different sizes. All workable sources.

## CRITICAL: LOCK STYLE GUIDE FIRST

Before ANY processing, define treatment for ALL images:
- Warm golden (3000K) - matches festive brief
- Burgundy gradient background - traditional feel
- 75% frame - consistent product dominance
- Warm color grade - cohesive campaign look

**Why lock first:** Campaign coherence requires IDENTICAL treatment. Adjusting mid-batch breaks consistency.

## EXECUTE -> VERIFY

[Per image_studio product family pattern, write_data campaign batch pattern]

**Consistency verification:**
- Lighting temperature: IDENTICAL across all 4
- Background gradient: IDENTICAL
- Product positioning: CONSISTENT progression (500ml -> 2L)

**Scores:** All 8.5+, campaign coherence PASS. Ship.
</reasoning>

<response>
"Processed 4 container variants for Diwali campaign.

**Style locked:** Warm golden, burgundy gradient, consistent composition

**Consistency:** Verified identical treatment across all variants

4 assets ready for approval, linked to camp-diwali-2024."
</response>

<note>
Example shows: (1) Lock style guide BEFORE processing, (2) Consistency verification is critical for campaigns
